霧 塗上樣本後落在皮膚的 致倦庫蚊平均數量\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cdca2f314b3544564e734eb923fe1d6b/2024-05/SPRAY_AA020.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"消委會驅蚊劑｜日本叮叮 全效版配方 驅蚊防蟲噴霧  塗上樣本後落在皮膚的 埃及伊蚊平均數量\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/25848572185ed1f213dd53c56ebdba1a/2024-05/SPRAY_AA021.png\"/>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-03T04:39:16.491210+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1054,"images":39,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}